# TTC-DERIVED renders.  Per the FSAE TTC agreement, only DE-IDENTIFIED,
# attributed plots may be published — so any screenshot showing measured tire
# grip (Fy-vs-SA, friction circle, cornering-stiffness-vs-load) for an
# IDENTIFIED tire must NOT ship.  Make tire-plot screenshots from the
# parametric LinearTireModel instead, or de-identify + credit FSAE TTC/Calspan.
screenshots/tire_plots.png
screenshots/*tire*grip*.png

# Reference spreadsheets (local only)
sus_calc_ref/

